      "rank_absolute": 1,
      "markdown": "If you're looking for **smart lock installation in Ascot Vale (VIC 3032)**, here are several well-reviewed local locksmiths that can install and configure most major smart lock brands:\n\n- Nice Locksmiths – Based on Mt Alexander Road in Ascot Vale, offering locksmith services including digital lock installations.\n- TLC Security Locksmiths – Essendon-based locksmith with experience in residential smart locks.\n- Lockstar Locksmiths – Kensington locksmith providing 24/7 service and smart lock installations.\n- Fast Brunswick Key Services – Nearby Brunswick locksmith with emergency and installation services.\n- Digital Door Locks Pty Ltd – Melbourne specialist in digital and smart door locks, supplying and supporting a wide range of brands.\n\nIf you already have a smart lock, most installers will:\n- Remove your existing lock.\n- Install and align the new hardware.\n- Configure the app, PINs, fingerprints, or access cards.\n- Test the lock and show you how to use it.\n\nTypical installation pricing in Melbourne is around **A$150–A$300** for a straightforward replacement, with additional costs if the door requires drilling, modification, or conversion from a mortice lock. [www.smartlockinstallation.com.au](https://www.smartlockinstallation.com.au/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nIf you haven't bought a lock yet, I can also recommend models that suit your door (timber, security screen, apartment, or mortice lock) and your preferred ecosystem (Apple HomeKit, Google Home, Alexa, or Samsung SmartThings).",
